      <title>从 bzImage 到嵌套虚拟机：用 QEMU/KVM 搭建 Subaru DENSO 车机调试环境</title>
      <link>https://blog.sparktour.me/posts/2026/10/19/subaru-denso-qemu-kvm-simulation/</link>
